{"id": "EUVD-2026-102493", "enisaUuid": "016e1205-b9dc-3868-8fb9-129a95bad6d3", "description": "Craftplan through 0.7.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the CRM Customer resource that allows unauthenticated attackers to create customer records via JSON:API and GraphQL. Attackers can send anonymous requests to POST /api/json/customers or the create_customer mutation to insert attacker-chosen names, contact details and addresses into the operator's CRM.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T21:43:40", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T14:24:29", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/craftplan-customer-public-write", "https://github.com/puemos/craftplan/blob/v0.7.5/lib/craftplan/crm/customer.ex#L91-L94", "https://github.com/puemos/craftplan/blob/v0.7.5/lib/craftplan/accounts/checks/api_scope_check.ex#L33-L40", "https://github.com/puemos/craftplan", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/craftplan-through-0.7.5-missing-authorization-via-crm-customer-json-api-and-graphql"], "aliases": ["GHSA-4pw4-44qq-2vmv", "CVE-2026-111349"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.3, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "b983e58a-6d0f-3e71-b5fe-8f2cde16faa4", "product": {"name": "craftplan", "vendor": {"name": "puemos"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.7.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4eb1880b-c15d-3420-9aff-68a7d364ca54", "vendor": {"name": "puemos"}}], "isExploited": false}